    p(f'Risk classifier: 6 standardized inputs - 16 hidden ReLU units - 2 logits. It uses four purchase fields plus two chemical consistency features. The small MLP represents interactions such as an unusual purchase accompanied by a declaration mismatch. Its combined validation macro F1 was {selected["validation"]["f1_macro"]:.4f}, narrowly above the weighted linear alternative. The architecture was frozen before test evaluation. The linear alternative later performed better on test, which is reported rather than used to reselect the model.')
